        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s964",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · For optimal dissolvability, we recomme…",
            "text": "For optimal dissolvability, we recommend preparing Bobbie with warm water, slightly warmer than room temperature.<br><br>Water used for mixing infant formula must be from a safe source, like distilled, purified, or nursery water. If using tap water, bring to a rolling boil for one minute and let cool for no more than 30 minutes. That being said, before using tap water, please check with your baby’s pediatrician for your baby’s unique safety needs. Learn how to make a formula bottle <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;line-height:22.88px\">here</span>.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s965",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · These recommendations are based on nor…",
            "text": "These recommendations are based on normal growth patterns for healthy term infants and are provided as general guidance to estimate how much Bobbie to order, always consult your infant’s healthcare provider to ensure your child's unique needs are being met.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s966",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The amount of formula and/or breast mi…",
            "text": "The amount of formula and/or breast milk your baby needs will vary as they grow. And although there is no custom guide, a baby feeding chart can help minimize guesswork.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s967",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Click here for Bobbie's in-depth feedi…",
            "text": "<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;line-height:22.88px\">Click here</span> for Bobbie's in-depth feeding guide that provides bundle recommendations based on daily intake data collected from hundreds of thousands of Bobbie parents!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    }
